 "intro": "When you combine an indirect pronoun with a direct pronoun (you give it to me, I tell you), the indirect changes: my → **me**, ti → **te**, gli / le → **glie-**, ci → **ce**, vi → **ve**. They are written separately except with gli-: **glielo**, **gliela**, **glieli**, **gliele**."
